flowchart TB
    user[User sets the goal]
    codex[Codex · Selected model<br/>Plan / Delegate / Independently review]
    mcp[MCP server · 7 tools<br/>stdio · Request IDs / Event cursors]
    ui[Optional Chinese dashboard<br/>Monitor or submit directly<br/>Direct tasks bypass Codex planning and review]
    user --> codex
    user -. Optional .-> ui
    codex <--> mcp
    subgraph daemon[Local daemon · Tasks survive client disconnect]
        rpc[Authenticated local RPC]
        queue[Serial queue / Continue / Cancel]
        monitor[15-second heartbeat<br/>Progress recorded separately<br/>300 seconds without progress: warn only]
        state[Atomic persistence / Interruption recovery<br/>Execution and review are separate]
        result[Output manifest / Paged reads<br/>Hashes / Stale-review detection]
        rpc <--> queue
        queue <--> state
        queue --> monitor
        rpc <--> result
    end
    mcp <--> rpc
    ui -. Local API .-> rpc
    queue --> runner[Separate process per run<br/>0 = No bridge duration or tool-count cutoff]
    subgraph harness[External DeepSeek Harness · Official headless]
        loop[Native agent loop / Sessions / Model provider]
        plugins[Native tools and plugins<br/>Commands / Dependencies / Tests as configured]
        guard[Files guard<br/>read / write / edit only]
        loop --> plugins
        loop --> guard
    end
    runner --> loop
    loop <--> deepseek[DeepSeek API · Separate billing<br/>deepseek-official / deepseek-flash / max]
    creds[Harness-managed credentials<br/>Key never passed through MCP] --> loop
    plugins -. Progress metadata .-> monitor
    subgraph workspace[Independent workspace · Not complete OS isolation]
        input[input · Explicit file copies]
        work[Project / Dependencies / Temporary files]
        output[output · Final deliverables]
        input --> work --> output
    end
    plugins -- agent · Opt-in --> work
    guard -- files · Default --> input
    guard --> output
    output --> result
    monitor --> state
    result -- Returned through RPC / MCP --> codex
    limitation[No execution during host sleep or shutdown<br/>Recovery marks interrupted; explicit continuation<br/>Bridge cannot wake an ended Codex turn]
    state -.-> limitation
